  "summary": "The dashboard exposes three views: HTTP Inspector (table of proxied requests with headers, bodies, SSE events, timing), Conversation View (chat-style timeline), and MCP Observer. The tool runs four localhost endpoints: reverse proxy on 8888, MCP proxy on 9999, and dashboard on 5000 (HTTP) and 5001 (HTTPS, auto-launching a browser on Windows).",
